{"final":{"answer":"The reserve for product warranties increased by $6 million from 2005 to 2006 (from $4 million to $10 million).","value":6,"unit":"million","sources":["source:q11n4","source:q11n3"],"result_id":"tool:1","explanation":"2006 reserve ($10 million) minus 2005 reserve ($4 million) = $6 million increase."}}